            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Take one teaspoonful of boiled rice in test tube A, and take a teaspoonful of boiled rice after chewing it for 30–60 seconds in test tube B."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
